            <ArticleTitle>[The Austrian LEAD (Lung hEart sociAL boDy) Study: Background of the Austrian Longitudinal Cohort Study].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>459-62</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
